  <content>
    <graph>
      <identifier v="desk_painted_steel" />
      <uid v="1001" />
      <graphtype v="material" />
      <attributes>
        <label v="School desk | aged enamel over steel" />
        <description v="Native procedural enamel / exposed steel / layered rust. Reference: props_01; method inspiration Andrea Riccardi. Tile = 20 cm; height range = 0.06 cm. OpenGL normal. Wear and Age are independent. Optional placement mask is additive, white = remove paint. Curvature should be pre-masked to selected exposed edges. No baked illumination in base color. 2026-09-10: local shallow enamel cracks; explicit coverage, scale, width, depth and chip rim controls. Shallow cracks stay dielectric. ExtraWear requires asset placement. Layer outputs support physical triplanar mapping." />
      </attributes>
